{
  "version": 2,
  "why": "Decouple callers from providers (N3) and stop losing messages (N1): a load-balanced notification API validates, checks preferences (cached), writes the log and returns 202; work goes into one durable queue per channel, drained by channel workers. A slow SMS vendor now only backs up the SMS queue. Flaw left: OTPs queue behind campaign messages in the same channel (N2), failed sends are just dropped after one retry, and nothing caps marketing per user.",
